# A scripted ride for the goldens: walk up to the bike and get on (as
# mount.script), wait on the pad, then full throttle north up the lane. The
# chase camera climbs toward the crest near frame 614; the rider camera then
# sees the block ahead. The throttle opens at 204, a multiple of the gauge's
# 6-step refresh past where it opened before getting on came first.
#   functor -d examples/hoverbike run native -- --input-script ride.script \
#     --capture-frame /tmp/f.png --capture-at-frame 614 --capture-size 1600x1200
10 W down
100 W up
120 E down
121 E up
204 W down
844 C down
845 C up
